{"content":[{"c":["GEDERAH, GEDERATHITES*"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Town and its inhabitants situated in the Shephelah (lowland hills) of the territory allotted to Judah’s tribe for an inheritance (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.15.36","r":"Josh.15.36","rawR":"Josh.15.36","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.15.36","value":"Josh.15.36"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 15:36"},"). It was a place where potters lived (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.4.23","r":"1Chr.4.23","rawR":"1Chr.4.23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.4.23","value":"1Chr.4.23"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 4:23"},"). A man from Gederah, Jozabad the Gederathite, is mentioned in ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.12.4","r":"1Chr.12.4","rawR":"1Chr.12.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.12.4","value":"1Chr.12.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 12:4"},"."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"GederahGederathites","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jos 15:36","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.15.36","rawQueryValue":"Josh.15.36","sourceRefExact":"Josh.15.36"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 4:23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.4.23","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.4.23","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.4.23"},{"anchorText":"1 Chronicles 12:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.12.4","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.12.4","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.12.4"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"ffc5542fcfe4ad7bb645f54597352bab365bd7bd29f2d6fe0a60b231b3bfcc6a","sourceItemName":"GederahGederathites","sourceItemOrder":74,"sourceMember":"Articles/G.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"GederahGederathites","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Gederah, Gederathites*","title":"Gederah, Gederathites*","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}